{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"7ee0e040-126a-4fe6-942f-2bb7aa16b452":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14486593241217__7ee0e040-126a-4fe6-942f-2bb7aa16b452-1678206211dc006287-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"CM viper indoor entrance mats"}},"template--14486593241217__7ee0e040-126a-4fe6-942f-2bb7aa16b452-1678206211dc006287-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>Made in house by the Canada Mats team, these mats offer the best value for your money. They also offer the fastest delivery dates, and the most flexibility for custom sizes.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14486593241217__7ee0e040-126a-4fe6-942f-2bb7aa16b452-1678206211dc006287-0","template--14486593241217__7ee0e040-126a-4fe6-942f-2bb7aa16b452-1678206211dc006287-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"326d1a90-7444-47a9-892e-fa22eb0701be":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/CM_Viper_8925_f844c371-6710-46d9-bcca-c7b4d5c24fbe.jpg","image_width":500,"subtitle":"our flagship mat","title":"CM VIPER 8925 mats","text":"<p>Ideal for large luxurious areas and grand entrances. The Viper 8925 is available in up to 6' wide and 100’ long pieces. It is also one of the only options with a vinyl backing .<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$11.00\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy CM VIPER 8925 mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/cm-viper-8925-wiper-scraper-matting-with-vinyl-backing","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"74af675b-1db2-4cf1-b012-5fcc7813d74b":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/cm9200_viperentrancemats_d_1_1080x_fbd8c3a9-5098-4611-82d4-accb3d292127.jpg","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"CM VIPER 9200 Mats","text":"<p>A looped dual fiber construction makes easy work of both debris and moisture at the door. The unique construction offers a luxurious aesthetic that lasts years defending your entrance.<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$12.00\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy cm viper 9200 mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/cm-viper-9200-wiper-scraper-matting","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"fbaa282c-5306-462e-b846-4f9ed8b04f9a":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14486593241217__fbaa282c-5306-462e-b846-4f9ed8b04f9a-1678206211dc006287-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"cm viper economy indoor mats"}},"template--14486593241217__fbaa282c-5306-462e-b846-4f9ed8b04f9a-1678206211dc006287-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>Made for lighter duty use, these mats are great for making your indoor entrance look polished and clean on a budget. Available up to 6' wide.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14486593241217__fbaa282c-5306-462e-b846-4f9ed8b04f9a-1678206211dc006287-0","template--14486593241217__fbaa282c-5306-462e-b846-4f9ed8b04f9a-1678206211dc006287-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"da1c4527-c31d-4b3b-aebb-612368c7c9c6":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14486593241217__da1c4527-c31d-4b3b-aebb-612368c7c9c6-1678206284db50f2e2-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/cm4500_viperrib_z_52f37aa1-61b3-45bb-901e-dc8515d8366d.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"VIPER RIB MATS","text":"<p>CM Viper Rib Entrance Mats are faced with coarse synthetic fibres looped into a ribbed pattern to absorb moisture while scraping away dirt and grime from shoes. Used in retail locations across North America, these mats are ideal for commercial entrances with moderate traffic.<\/p><p><\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$6.00\/SqFt<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy Viper Rib Mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/cm-viper-rib-entrance-mats"}},"template--14486593241217__da1c4527-c31d-4b3b-aebb-612368c7c9c6-1678206284db50f2e2-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_46_1197716e-652a-4b30-a101-87f55fc62d48.png","image_width":650,"title":"viper 2000 poly-plush mats","text":"<p>CM Viper 2000 Poly-Plush Mats are low profile entrance mats made from tufted yarns combined with a PVC vinyl backing. These classic mats are ideal for indoor commercial entrances with low to moderate foot traffic and are highly economical.<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$6.00\/SqFt<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy poly-plush mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/viper-2000-plush-olefin-entrance-mats"}},"template--14486593241217__da1c4527-c31d-4b3b-aebb-612368c7c9c6-1678206284db50f2e2-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_40_2a3fb8af-8d43-48f9-b353-0fa8a04a407e.png","image_width":650,"title":"viper 2500 needle-pin mats","text":"<p>Viper 2500 Needle-Pin Mats are constructed of a looped dual fibre material to absorb moisture and scrape away dirt with its coarse yarns. With a durable PVC vinyl backing, these mats are ideal for indoor and outdoor use in moderate to low traffic areas.<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$6.00\/SqFt<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy needle-pin mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/viper-2500-stylepoint-entrance-mats"}}},"block_order":["template--14486593241217__da1c4527-c31d-4b3b-aebb-612368c7c9c6-1678206284db50f2e2-0","template--14486593241217__da1c4527-c31d-4b3b-aebb-612368c7c9c6-1678206284db50f2e2-1","template--14486593241217__da1c4527-c31d-4b3b-aebb-612368c7c9c6-1678206284db50f2e2-2"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"1220b7da-31c9-4d06-b3c7-fdb92b3dca75":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14486593241217__1220b7da-31c9-4d06-b3c7-fdb92b3dca75-1678206211dc006287-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"Other indoor mats"}},"template--14486593241217__1220b7da-31c9-4d06-b3c7-fdb92b3dca75-1678206211dc006287-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":false,"text":"<p>These mats are economical options that include special functions such as being machine-washable or having many colour options.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14486593241217__1220b7da-31c9-4d06-b3c7-fdb92b3dca75-1678206211dc006287-0","template--14486593241217__1220b7da-31c9-4d06-b3c7-fdb92b3dca75-1678206211dc006287-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"88fa13d9-6518-403e-8d65-f90bada693f5":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14486593241217__88fa13d9-6518-403e-8d65-f90bada693f5-1678206284db50f2e2-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_43_e6c87f13-aef9-484b-8e25-4546cedaaa89.png","image_width":650,"title":"Heather Plush Premium Mats","text":"<p>These entrance mats feature a carpet surface and vinyl backing. These mats are ideal for indoor commercial environments such as office carpets and flooring.<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$3.33\/SqF<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy heather plush mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/heather-plush-premium-mats-18"}},"template--14486593241217__88fa13d9-6518-403e-8d65-f90bada693f5-1678206284db50f2e2-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/color-star_0083c728-0d0f-4722-b860-103d0d0c74fa.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"Colorstar mats","text":"<p>ColorStar mats feature the static dissipative Perma Dye with Stain Stopper dye system that insures the best colorfastness among all yarn-dyed mats on the market today.<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$6.17\/SqFt<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy colorstar mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/tri-grip-mats-18"}},"template--14486593241217__88fa13d9-6518-403e-8d65-f90bada693f5-1678206284db50f2e2-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/cm3500-ultratuft-d_1_1080x_d57ff35d-89ab-4b3f-a5f3-da736acd4c11.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"Ultra tuft carpet entrance mats","text":"<p>These mats are constructed with blended synthetic fibres with a PVC vinyl backing to wick away moisture and hide collected dirt. These mats are ideal for indoor secondary entrances in high-end commercial spaces.<\/p><p><em>Starting from<\/em><strong> <\/strong><em><strong>$10.00\/SqFt<\/strong><\/em><\/p>","button_label":"buy ultra tuft entrance mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/ultra-tuft-carpet-entrance-mats"}}},"block_order":["template--14486593241217__88fa13d9-6518-403e-8d65-f90bada693f5-1678206284db50f2e2-0","template--14486593241217__88fa13d9-6518-403e-8d65-f90bada693f5-1678206284db50f2e2-1","template--14486593241217__88fa13d9-6518-403e-8d65-f90bada693f5-1678206284db50f2e2-2"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"1fec6fe8-e1c0-4e54-b283-4ac5b9422f69":{"type":"featured-collection","settings":{"title":"","home_featured_products":"indoor-entrance-mats","per_row":5,"rows":3,"mobile_scrollable":true,"view_all":false,"divider":false}}},"order":["main","7ee0e040-126a-4fe6-942f-2bb7aa16b452","326d1a90-7444-47a9-892e-fa22eb0701be","74af675b-1db2-4cf1-b012-5fcc7813d74b","fbaa282c-5306-462e-b846-4f9ed8b04f9a","da1c4527-c31d-4b3b-aebb-612368c7c9c6","1220b7da-31c9-4d06-b3c7-fdb92b3dca75","88fa13d9-6518-403e-8d65-f90bada693f5","1fec6fe8-e1c0-4e54-b283-4ac5b9422f69"]}